37
00:01:39.334 --> 00:01:46.309
Up, Up, Up! Down, Down, Down! In, In, In! Out, Out, Out!

38
00:01:46.359 --> 00:01:55.113
On, On, On! Under, Under, Under! Over, Over, Over! Behind, Behind, Behind!

39
00:01:55.163 --> 00:01:58.369
Clap, clap! Great chanting!

40
00:01:59.052 --> 00:02:06.793
The cat jumps up on the chair. The ball rolls under the table. Where is the puppy? It is behind the door!

41
00:02:06.843 --> 00:02:09.262
