42
00:02:10.344 --> 00:02:15.827
What is it? Can you say it?

43
00:02:15.877 --> 00:02:18.000
Up! Well done!

44
00:02:19.278 --> 00:02:25.546
What is it? Can you say it?

45
00:02:25.596 --> 00:02:28.013
Out! Well done!

46
00:02:28.811 --> 00:02:34.397
What is it? Can you say it?

47
00:02:34.447 --> 00:02:36.913
Over! Well done!

48
00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:40.296
Let's say it together!

49
00:02:40.346 --> 00:02:45.016
The ball is under the table. The cat is on the chair.

50
00:02:45.066 --> 00:02:49.432
Your turn!

51
00:02:49.482 --> 00:02:53.684
The ball is under the table. The cat is on the chair.

52
00:02:54.397 --> 00:02:59.132
Where is your bag?

53
00:02:59.182 --> 00:03:01.312
The ball is under the table.

54
00:03:01.362 --> 00:03:02.626
Great answer!

55
00:03:03.630 --> 00:03:08.253
Today's value is attention. Look carefully and listen well.

56
